{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfTsPt5iBgCCKS2akPFsq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't find a specification to work on. The working directory (`<workspace>`) is empty. The repo above it has no commits and only contains `.gitconfig` and git metadata.\n\nTo go ahead, I need:\n\n1. **The specification.** A file path, or paste it here.\n2. **The failed assessment, if you have one.** Its findings (material omissions, false assurance, stale or missing evidence, and so on) tell me exactly which obligations to fix.\n3. **The reliance you're aiming for.** Is it ready for discussion, implementation, integration, operation, or a specific claim? What counts as \"ready\" depends on which one.\n4. **The actual evidence.** Test results, reviews, measurements, with the revision or date each one applies to.\n\nI'll fix the obligations: vague or untestable wording, missing requirements, and claims filed under the wrong type. I'll rewrite the evidence section so each obligation points to evidence that exists and is current. Where evidence is missing or out of date, I'll mark it as a gap, open unknown, or condition instead of wording around it. I won't write evidence that doesn't exist just to get a pass, because that's exactly the false assurance an assessment is meant to catch.\n\nOnce the revision is done, I can run the assessment on it for your target reliance so you can see what still blocks readiness."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":215,"cache_read_input_tokens":10661,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":215},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c4e575c-a1a9-4648-b251-5689079d396d","uuid":"cd1d8aad-720c